26-04-01T18:03:20Z"},"body":"Supersedes #92039\r\nBased on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92039#issuecomment-3215662278 (I didn't add co-author, because the code has diverged a lot)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d09feea-d786-4a13-a8b2-c5d5ba3bb08a\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Old</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9d53bfd-a301-4e36-89ce-08ed0c11b4e1\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nThis adds filter buttons that allow hiding built-in or custom types from create dialog. Unlike the previous PR, I also added a switch for editor types and now it's possible to add editor nodes to your scene (which is useful for plugins). Some classes shouldn't be instantiated from this dialog, so I made them virtual.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111518/reactions","total_count":39,"+1":20,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":13,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111518/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"s